# Cursor Skill Physical Copy Contract

Use this rule when creating, editing, or syncing `.cursor/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md`.

Cursor project skills are physical copies. Each `SKILL.md` must contain:
1. Cursor-required YAML frontmatter: `name` and `description`.
2. The corresponding `09_cursor/skills/*.md` body embedded directly after the frontmatter.

Do not replace a skill body with routing text such as "read `09_cursor/skills/...`".

When updating a source skill under `09_cursor/skills/`, refresh the matching `.cursor/skills/<skill>/SKILL.md` body and keep the frontmatter intact.

Update `09_cursor/skills/INDEX.md` when adding, removing, or changing the skill set.
